// Stress 7: retry with a time budget
//
// EXPECTED FINDINGS
//   `retry ... max 3` is accepted; the 30 s budget has no syntax in retry
//   Workaround: ambient `restart max 3 within 30 s` covers the ambient class only; budget on the system is a PLAN024 Warn without evidence
// NOT EXPRESSIBLE (see ../GAPS.md)
//   time-bounded retry on a domain outcome -- GAPS.md G3

system s { budget retry_window 30 s; }
scenario pay { u.pays => { declined -> retry u.pays max 3 else end err(declined); ok -> end ok; } }
